            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.8.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“The prophets mislead my people by saying that all is well. All is certainly not well! My people have put up a wall of loose stones, and then the prophets have come and covered it with whitewash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell the prophets that their wall is going to fall down. I will send a pouring rain. Hailstones will fall on it, and a strong wind will blow against it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wall will collapse, and everyone will ask you what good the whitewash did.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
