            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Now, mortal man, look at the women among your people who make up predictions. Denounce them ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and tell them what the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is saying to them:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You women are doomed! You sew magic wristbands for everyone and make magic scarves for everyone to wear on their heads, so that they can have power over other people's lives. You want to possess the power of life and death over my people and to use it for your own benefit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You dishonour me in front of my people in order to get a few handfuls of barley and a few pieces of bread. You kill people who don't deserve to die, and you keep people alive who don't deserve to live. So you tell lies to my people, and they believe you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
